### B.3 CenEVT Fitting and Online Adaptation

```
Algorithm 3: Censoring-Aware GPD Fitting and Online Threshold Adaptation
Input:  Training reconstruction errors with censoring labels
        R_train = {(r_i, flag_i, c_i)}_{i=1}^{N_train}
          where flag_i ∈ {OBS, RIGHT_CENS, LEFT_CENS}
        Sliding window buffer R_window (size N_adapt)
        Prior parameters (ξ_0, σ_0), penalty weights (w_ξ, w_σ)
Output: Alert thresholds τ_D, τ_PI, τ_C^cons; GPD params (ξ, σ, u, ζ_u)

INITIALIZATION — OFFLINE CENSORED FIT:
  u ← percentile({r_i : flag_i = OBS}, 95)
  ζ_u ← |{r_i > u}| / N_train

  // Partition into observed, right-censored, left-censored
  O ← {i : flag_i = OBS and r_i > u}
  R ← {j : flag_j = RIGHT_CENS and c_j > u}
  L ← {k : flag_k = LEFT_CENS and c_k > u}

  // Constrained reparameterization
  ξ = 0.5·tanh(ψ);   σ = exp(ν)

  // Penalized censored negative log-likelihood
  NLL(ψ, ν) =
      −Σ_{i∈O} [−ν − (1 + 1/ξ) log(1 + ξ·(r_i−u)/σ)]
      −Σ_{j∈R} [−(1/ξ) log(1 + ξ·(c_j−u)/σ)]
      −Σ_{k∈L} log[1 − (1 + ξ·(c_k−u)/σ)^(−1/ξ)]
      + λ_pen · [w_ξ·(ξ−ξ_0)² + w_σ·(log σ − log σ_0)²]

  λ_pen ← select_by_cross_validation(λ_grid, held_out_exceedances)
  (ψ*, ν*) ← L_BFGS_minimize(NLL, ψ_init=0, ν_init=log(std(O)))
  ξ, σ ← 0.5·tanh(ψ*), exp(ν*)

  // Threshold derivation
  τ_D  ← POT_quantile(0.95,  u, ξ, σ, ζ_u)
  τ_PI ← POT_quantile(0.999, u, ξ, σ, ζ_u)
  τ_C  ← POT_quantile(0.9999,u, ξ, σ, ζ_u)

  // Threshold uncertainty (delta method + bootstrap)
  Σ_θ ← inverse_fisher_information(NLL, ψ*, ν*)
  var_τC ← delta_method_variance(τ_C, u, ξ, σ, ζ_u, Σ_θ)
  boot_τC ← bootstrap_thresholds(B=2000, censored_likelihood)
  τ_C^cons ← max(τ_C + 1.96·√var_τC,
                 percentile(boot_τC, 97.5))

  log_initial_fit(ξ, σ, u, ζ_u, τ_D, τ_PI, τ_C, τ_C^cons, λ_pen)

ONLINE ADAPTATION (executed every T_adapt = 10 s):
  R_window ← sliding_window_buffer.get_latest(N_adapt)
  R_nominal ← {r ∈ R_window : r < τ_D}
  censor_flags_window ← associated censoring labels

  if |R_nominal| > 0.8 · N_adapt:
    u_new ← percentile(R_nominal, 95)
    recompute O, R, L sets with u_new
    ξ_new, σ_new ← censored_MLE(O, R, L, ξ_0, σ_0, λ_pen)

    // Exponential smoothing for stability
    ξ ← 0.9·ξ + 0.1·ξ_new
    σ ← 0.9·σ + 0.1·σ_new
    u ← 0.9·u + 0.1·u_new
    ζ_u ← 0.9·ζ_u + 0.1·(|{r ∈ R_nominal : r > u_new}| / |R_nominal|)

    recompute(τ_D, τ_PI, τ_C, τ_C^cons)
    log_threshold_update(t, ξ, σ, u, ζ_u, τ_D, τ_PI, τ_C, τ_C^cons)
  else:
    log_adaptation_deferred(t, reason="insufficient_nominal_samples")
```

