### B.4 Failure Diversity Evaluation Protocol

```
Algorithm 4: Failure Diversity Evaluation and CCF Quantification
Input:  Fault signature library F = {f_1,...,f_K}
        N-version ensemble {V_1, V_2, V_3} with V2 = {V2a, V2b, V2c}
        Ground truth outcome label for each fault signature
Output: β_CCF, pairwise β_ij, diversity indices D(i,j),
        redesign recommendation set

FOR EACH fault signature f_k in F:

  // Inject identical fault into all version input streams
  // (common-cause injection test)
  for i = 1 to 3:
    a_i(f_k) ← V_i.recommend(f_k)
    F_i(f_k) ← [a_i(f_k) ≠ a_true(f_k)]     // failure indicator

  // Ensemble member outputs for V2
  s_2a ← V2a.score(f_k); s_2b ← V2b.score(f_k); s_2c ← V2c.score(f_k)
  disp_2(f_k) ← normalized_dispersion(s_2a, s_2b, s_2c)

  // Record behavioral output for diversity index
  behavior_vector(f_k) ← (a_1, a_2, a_3)

COMPUTE MARGINAL FAILURE PROBABILITIES:
  for i = 1 to 3:
    P_i ← (1/K) Σ_k F_i(f_k)

COMPUTE PAIRWISE JOINT FAILURES:
  for each pair (i,j):
    P_ij ← (1/K) Σ_k F_i(f_k)·F_j(f_k)
    β_ij ← P_ij / min(P_i, P_j)         // if min(P_i,P_j) > 0
    if min(P_i, P_j) == 0:
      β_ij ← 0    // no failures to share; log as inconclusive

COMPUTE SYSTEM-LEVEL CCF:
  n_multi ← |{f_k : Σ_i F_i(f_k) ≥ 2}|
  n_any   ← |{f_k : Σ_i F_i(f_k) ≥ 1}|
  β_CCF ← n_multi / n_any    (if n_any > 0, else 0)

COMPUTE DIVERSITY INDICES:
  for each pair (i,j):
    D_str(i,j) ← normalized_hamming(taxonomy_vector(i), taxonomy_vector(j))
    D_beh(i,j) ← disagreement_rate(behavior_vector_i, behavior_vector_j)
    D_rel(i,j) ← 1 − Cramers_V(F_i, F_j)
    D(i,j) ← 0.3·D_str + 0.4·D_beh + 0.3·D_rel

  mean_dispersion ← mean_k(disp_2(f_k))

EVALUATION AND RECOMMENDATION:
  for each pair (i,j):
    if β_ij > 0.05:
      ADD to redesign_set: (i,j, β_ij)
      RECOMMEND: increase structural diversity of pair
                 (change algorithm class, training data lineage,
                  or feature representation)

  if β_CCF > 0.05:
    FLAG architecture as non-compliant with diversity requirement
    RECOMMEND: heterogeneous ensemble expansion for V2,
               specification divergence review for shared components
  else:
    CERTIFY diversity requirement satisfied

  if mean_dispersion > 0.3:
    FLAG V2 ensemble as internally decorrelated on average
  else:
    FLAG V2 ensemble members as insufficiently diverse;
    RECOMMEND: alter inductive bias of at least one member

  return (β_CCF, {β_ij}, {D(i,j)}, redesign_set, mean_dispersion)
```

